---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "About Me"
description: "Professional background, practical experience, technical skills, and education of Abhishek Dahal."
permalink: "/about/"
---

<div class="section">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <header class="section-header">
      <h1>About Abhishek Dahal</h1>
      <p class="section-subtitle">Web developer with practical experience across frontend code, CMS platforms, and digital projects.</p>
    </header>

    {# Professional Biography #}
    <section style="margin-bottom: 3.5rem;">
      <h2>Background & Focus</h2>
      <p>
        I am a web developer with practical experience building, maintaining, and improving websites across diverse environments. Having worked with agencies and product companies including <strong>Pagoda Labs</strong> and <strong>ThemeGrill</strong>, I bridge the gap between frontend development, CMS customisation, server infrastructure, and content publishing.
      </p>
      <p>
        My work focuses on building clean, fast, and accessible websites using <strong>WordPress, Webflow, OpenCart</strong>, and modern semantic web standards. In addition to technical execution, I have hands-on experience configuring website hosting on Linode, managing DNS records, setting up databases, and coordinating directly with clients and cross-functional teams to deliver projects on time.
      </p>
      <p>
        Currently completing an <strong>MSc in Data Science (Distinction)</strong> at the University of Greenwich, I also bring analytical problem-solving, structured workflows, and data processing capabilities to digital solutions.
      </p>
    </section>

    {# Skills by Category #}
    <section style="margin-bottom: 3.5rem;">
      <h2>Technical Skills & Platforms</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">All skill categories are editable directly from <code>src/_data/site.json</code>.</p>
      <div class="skills-grid">
        {% for group in site.skills %}
          <div class="skill-card">
            <h3 class="skill-card__title">{{ group.category }}</h3>
            <ul class="skill-card__list">
              {% for item in group.items %}
                <li><span class="tag">{{ item }}</span></li>
              {% endfor %}
            </ul>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>

    {# Work Experience History #}
    <section style="margin-bottom: 3.5rem;">
      <h2>Work Experience</h2>
      <div class="timeline" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
        {% for job in site.experience %}
          <article class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-item__header">
              <div>
                <span class="timeline-item__role">{{ job.role }}</span>
                <span style="color: var(--text-muted);"> &bull; </span>
                <strong class="timeline-item__company">{{ job.company }}</strong>
                {% if job.location %}
                  <span style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem;"> ({{ job.location }})</span>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
              <span class="timeline-item__period">{{ job.period }}</span>
            </div>
            <p class="timeline-item__summary">{{ job.summary }}</p>
            <ul class="timeline-item__bullets">
              {% for bullet in job.highlights %}
                <li>{{ bullet }}</li>
              {% endfor %}
            </ul>
          </article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>

    {# Education #}
    <section style="margin-bottom: 3.5rem;">
      <h2>Education</h2>
      <div class="timeline" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
        {% for edu in site.education %}
          <article class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-item__header">
              <span class="timeline-item__role">{{ edu.degree }}</span>
              <span class="timeline-item__period">{{ edu.year }}</span>
            </div>
            <p style="color: var(--text-primary); font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 0;">
              {{ edu.institution }} &bull; <span style="color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 400;">{{ edu.location }}</span>
            </p>
          </article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>

    {# Next Steps / Call to Action #}
    <div style="padding: 2rem; background-color: var(--bg-surface); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-md); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem;">
      <div>
        <h3 style="margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">Interested in collaborating?</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">Let's discuss how my web development experience can support your team.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn--primary">
        Get In Touch &rarr;
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
